{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "5950a00f4f04fed713b605760ba4622cdbf9dafed52f9f7eb482c8e2ca6c3650", "ja": "試練の火蓋！", "zh": "考验开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "50df3dfb1420eb9dda0d79cefcde883ec9fb2a20a982d502f0c7e2a1db74c05f", "ja": "公演の宣伝をかねて、ミニステージに出演\nする5人。しかしあまり注目してもらえず、\n焦る琴葉。元気な海美と、ふんわりした\n美也のトークのおかげで何とか注目を集める\nことに成功するが、責任を感じてしまう。", "zh": "五人举办了一场小型表演，顺便宣传公演，\n却没有多少人驻足观赏，琴叶因此心焦如焚。\n多亏海美充满活力与美也温吞的谈话内容，\n表演总算引起关注，\n琴叶却依然自责不已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f97610499e6bbe0918afbfe84f38547dbcab42b1af991cf433bc8b5d7651c525", "ja": "（今日は宣伝も兼ねて、ショッピングモール内で\n灼熱少女のミニステージを行うことになった！）", "zh": "（今天『灼热少女』要在购物中心内举办小型表演，\n顺便进行宣传！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "33a0cc9b44b4435a25467ab49fa773c94e6cef860762d9c36b2fd421c7dfab39", "ja": "{$P$}。\n今日のステージは、絶対に成功させないとですよね。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n今天的表演绝对要成功对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1002_017kth", "source_sha256": "5a7ba7721554c61a611d356f433fb08806727e6579bccdc811e8d177dc94fd62", "ja": "せっかく本番公演の前に、こうして外で歌える、\n貴重な機会をいただいたんですから……。", "zh": "毕竟难得有珍贵的机会，\n可以像这样在正式公演前公开演唱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "e6abd26676caa0c6d2d755354415ed3db217312f392b3fc3548bee612f76cece", "ja": "確かに今日のステージが上手くいけば、いい宣伝には\nなると思うが……まずは、練習どおりにいこう。", "zh": "今天如果表演成功，确实可以成为不错的宣传……\n但你们先按照练习来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "5aba09b1ab722bc01ca087bf2051bbe255fbdb1478357461c2cf454c031603ba", "ja": "みなさん、初めまして！　私達は765プロの\n新しいアイドルユニットで、『灼熱少女』といいます。", "zh": "大家好！我们是765艺能的新偶像团体，\n叫做『灼热少女』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "33352ba82d514469c31ca1751a2c37f69ed6f3d4e4184d0a1546be2cbd439139", "ja": "今度、765プロライブ劇場で\n私達初めての公演が行われる予定で……。", "zh": "我们接下来预定在765艺能演唱会剧场，\n举行首次公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1007_null", "source_sha256": "4867af6b834cf0e32a67d0c5ca7648a6d868024fae5fc599b2a9a416630741f1", "ja": "（ザワザワ……ザワザワ……）", "zh": "（吵杂……吵杂……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "dffe61e93aacd47d33c8e0550067c8c08bf5e3bde6e697f292c625386448ca8c", "ja": "おや～？　おかしいですね～。\nみなさん、聞こえてないんでしょうか～。", "zh": "哎呀～？真奇怪呢～\n大家是不是没听见呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "93a6a41795f0ab4e58901369228c028eceec346f872c400f973b27df3f62febb", "ja": "（……人通りは多いが、立ち止まる人はそう多くない。\nこのアウェー感、琴葉には少し厳しかっただろうか）", "zh": "（……来往人潮虽多，却没有多少人驻足。\n这种孤立感对琴叶来说，会不会有点难以适应呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "9f5f8622b49120ce147da81eca2422be224ac898c6f488b68579c2abb1a1ea55", "ja": "ねえ、うみみ。\nみんな、ことはのお話聞いてないみたいだぞ……？", "zh": "欸，海美美，\n大家好像都没在听琴叶说话耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "dd658892a5e6db08c190128101dbc6fc370b98b3b925994f5f66b8b9d36e347f", "ja": "う、うーん……。でも大丈夫っ！\nみんな、ちゃんと聞いてくれるはず……って、琴葉？", "zh": "唔、唔～嗯……不过放心吧！\n大家肯定会好好听她说的……咦？琴叶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "f4ca1fa5f3eeb380e2cf8df98ef696f0dd181400cf3c7c746bc6c06b9483fddc", "ja": "あれ？　琴葉どしたの、MC続けないの？\n早くしないと、曲始まっちゃうよ。", "zh": "奇怪？琴叶你怎么了，不继续主持吗？\n不快点说下去，就要开始放歌了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "5e15d7a52a140dd1ee393cba42d5d59fb3f3773a9ac4fbf757972af3a270f097", "ja": "で、でも……こんな雰囲気じゃ、曲に入るなんて……。\nどうしよう、なんて言えば注目してもらえるのか……。", "zh": "可、可是……怎么能在这种气氛下开始唱歌……\n怎么办？该说什么才能引起关注呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "a7d1c08ebfd8dcf0a6f14e0b2a6690be8f962e8ebc934f9a1faea0f303be68c6", "ja": "……わかったよ、琴葉！\n私が、みんなの視線をひきつけてみせるっ！", "zh": "……我知道了，琴叶！\n我来吸引大家的目光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "4f63c5cecfd68c8310de7fb30c6e78312f526ff73f67328c6ef06d0c1c3c8bd7", "ja": "あっ、うみみ！？", "zh": "啊，海美美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "9d114f18391aed4854351189fdaa1ad57a791ee6a606225212b1991963660bd0", "ja": "みーーーーーーんなーーーーーーーーーーっ！！\nちゅーーーーーーもーーーーーーーーーくっ！！", "zh": "大──────家──────────！！\n看──────这─────────里！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "956b261316022e8ab624c4ee28d5e86e90ef4a514ad31925fbf378a1efa3d38e", "ja": "（海美！？）", "zh": "（海美！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1019_okyaku", "source_sha256": "7b6578bef446daa9191c5c8ffe07989949cb190facaa309ddcfaa134e280f438", "ja": "うわっ……でっかい声。なんだなんだ？", "zh": "哇……好大声，怎么了、怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "992da7fda9f93bc4eede91c89feda2bfae07364da4f51dacb68c227f3e535aac", "ja": "やった！　みんな、こっち見てくれた！\n……けど、この後何も考えてない！　どうしよ～！？", "zh": "成功了！大家都看向这边了！\n……不过，我完全没考虑下一步！怎么办～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "b466e77f875740881386eeafb29ea9dc864ea6d64393aeabae9c3da12f1c91d4", "ja": "は～い。みなさん、注目してくれましたね～。\n海美ちゃん、これから何があるんですか～？", "zh": "好了～大家都看过来了呢～\n海美，接下来有什么事吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "72f566e3f584486c4828977e1ba3b6a8a4b888e70a3682d62c7bcf6bf20c8910", "ja": "いやいや、美也……それ聞く？\nアタシ達、今から5人で歌うんでしょ！", "zh": "不不不，美也……你还问这个？\n我们五个人接下来不是要一起唱歌吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "4ffe79a32b4ac21178b1f826b9374538e4b5de4d1103b7340a0868058845085f", "ja": "お～。そういえば、そうでしたね～。\nみなさん、私達これから、ここで歌うんですよ～。", "zh": "哦～你这么一说，我才想起来了呢～\n大家，我们接下来要在这里唱歌喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1024_okyaku", "source_sha256": "4f11718f729bb66084d11490282ca0f075934e8f8bb0b2ad466fc50dd05f3693", "ja": "プッ！", "zh": "噗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1025_okyaku", "source_sha256": "6597d6afc430baa586afdc825e7645eda71338593314252c2bc5b8c5de6c6533", "ja": "あははは……！　なんだか面白い子達だなあ！", "zh": "啊哈哈哈……！这群女孩感觉真有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "94ec80d3e542f2930c31ac459b6a9af8826d6f354e0a1320904c1909ac410207", "ja": "う、ウケた！", "zh": "他、他们笑了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "8e0d7bb1f4ac5f592b6b7af13795b0b3cc539bfb119cb508cdcd03ddac3eca26", "ja": "たまきも！　たまきも歌うぞ～！\nみんな、たまきの歌、聞いていってね！", "zh": "环也是！环也要唱歌喔～！\n大家要听环唱歌喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "5f4d58249bae16bd94fe3f54b8a70466bee2ed53c8aa402d1704aeb07f10370f", "ja": "ああ、なんかMCになってないけど……ま、いっか！\nあったまったし、このまま曲行こう、琴葉！", "zh": "唉唉，好像一点都不像主持了……算了！\n反正气氛也炒热了，就这样开始唱歌吧，琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1029_017kth", "source_sha256": "d9c6a1b4c72e50224af089655885359c028cbdabae91b7a6556216c0e26cb67b", "ja": "あっ……うん！　それでは、聞いてください！\n『灼熱少女』で……。", "zh": "啊……好！那么，请听我们为各位带来这首歌！\n『灼热少女』的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1030_017kth", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1031_020meg", "source_sha256": "6469f63d9627cb4e0a4a6e1fcfbe31536634a1f262d7c64e37bf257b96b2dc36", "ja": "こ～とはっ！　なに暗い顔してんの？\nミニライブ、大成功だったじゃん！", "zh": "琴～叶！你干嘛一脸忧郁？\n迷你演唱会不是非常成功吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1032_017kth", "source_sha256": "78b1bd555f422777a1704ef8bb14b0ac692ce4409c0cc081333fcdde3fb5db46", "ja": "うん。みんなが盛り上げてくれたおかげだね。\nやっぱり、すごいな……。", "zh": "嗯，都要多亏有大家帮忙炒热气氛呢。\n大家果然很厉害……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1033_017kth", "source_sha256": "623551288fd14fd5554e503e386229308e39347943fe281c96f559f318dbd9b8", "ja": "それに引き換え、私……リーダーとしても、\nセンターとしても、全然ちゃんとできてなくて……。", "zh": "相较之下我却……不管是队长还是Center，\n我做得一点都不称职……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1034_020meg", "source_sha256": "826931e4e2ed548418c31dccef55037883525565ef06636590543d30cf083d1d", "ja": "そんなに深刻になるコトないって！　あんなの、失敗の\nうちに入らないよ。ね、{$P$}！", "zh": "不需要想得那么复杂啦！那点小事根本算不上是失败。\n对吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1035_p", "source_sha256": "8399f2dcd1266ef1ee9ca5165522f6b7c3d78199f697b29351a39b0f3ac402fe", "ja": "恵美の言うとおりだぞ、琴葉。\nむしろ本番に向けて、いい練習になったと思う。", "zh": "惠美说得没错，琴叶。\n我倒觉得这成了正式演出前的好练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1036_017kth", "source_sha256": "306ab05bb5d4ca6358cdedfd699971fb60df41e490f0cc449113c10b4b9f7160", "ja": "恵美、{$P$}……そうですね。\n今日のこと、ちゃんと今後に生かさないと……。", "zh": "惠美、{$P$}……说得也是。\n今后我得好好活用今天的经验才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "928c2ea2acaef066396786be81694a7c0a662965a2f1423ab078b8082e7dc366", "ja": "よーし、それじゃ気分転換にアイス食べに行こっ！\nみんなも誘って、ね♪", "zh": "好～那我们去吃冰淇淋转换心情吧！\n还要约大家一起去喔，好吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "b2db60c0caf8399b62429ea97ac0b7d75493a9b783d060ed214aae388fc6b95e", "ja": "うん……ありがとう、恵美。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你，惠美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1039_020meg", "source_sha256": "5c9ac4d37b0ac7177a665a8f93de3b504de5046fd3e512ab2046e219d4863079", "ja": "決まり！\nねえねえみんな、この後なんだけど～……！", "zh": "那就决定啰！\n大家听我说，接下来啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0027_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_03_1041_p", "source_sha256": "41be0c8547b146a6e914e8db8f6419f1a34d5a6337ae98ee1cf47352f6cd6798", "ja": "（琴葉、まだ少し気にしているみたいだな。\nうまく気持ちを切り替えられるといいんだが……）", "zh": "（琴叶好像还有点在意。\n希望她能顺利调整好心态……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
